    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/61682c431f210a77f67690ac/2waqKXFlMbr8SGggfoPmk.png) ⟨28⟩\nLLM-OS-Models⟨28⟩\n/\ndsc-370m-fineweb-edu-1b-v4⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nFollow\n![⟨30⟩] LLM-OS-Models 12\n Text Generation ⟨31⟩ PyTorch ⟨32⟩ English ⟨33⟩ dsc ⟨34⟩ dynamic-sparse-caching ⟨35⟩ gdn-2 ⟨36⟩ gated-deltanet ⟨37⟩ linear-attention ⟨38⟩ recurrent ⟨39⟩ fineweb-edu ⟨40⟩ pretraining ⟨41⟩ LLM-OS-Models ⟨42⟩ leak-fixed ⟨43⟩ entropy-bias ⟨44⟩ attention-pool ⟨45⟩\nLicense: apache-2.0\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨46⟩ Community ⟨47⟩\nCopy to bucket new\n  * DSC 370M (FineWeb-Edu 1B) — v4 sanity check⟨48⟩\n    * 1. v4 gate criteria⟨49⟩\n    * 2. What's new in v4⟨50⟩\n    * 3. Citation⟨51⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨48⟩ DSC 370M (FineWeb-Edu 1B) — v4 sanity check   \n|   |   |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| **Status**  | 🟢 **v4 1B sanity check — gate decision input.** Tests whether v4's architectural improvements (entropy bias + attention-pool descriptor) preserve v3's already-good 1B loss before escalating to 5B.  |  \n| **Architecture**  | DSC = GDN-2 + Dynamic Sparse Caching + Idea 1 (learnable attention-pool `desc_attn_v`) + Idea 2 (`ent_bias_scale` entropy bias on routing logits)  |  \n| **Parameters**  | ~370 M  |  \n| **Training data**  | FineWeb-Edu sample/100BT (1 B-token slice)  |  \n| **Tokenizer**  | TinyLlama v1.1 (vocab = 32 000)  |  \n| **Context length**  | 4 096 (training)  |  \n| **Hardware**  | 8 × NVIDIA H200 141 GB (FSDP)  |  \n| **Loss @ 1B**  | see `docs/DSC_LIVE_STATUS_KO.md`  |  \n| **License**  | Apache-2.0  |  \n| **Trained by**  |  LLM-OS-Models⟨28⟩ · code at gyunggyung/long-gdn⟨52⟩  |  \n* * *\n##   ⟨49⟩ 1. v4 gate criteria \nThe 1B v4 model is evaluated head-to-head against the 1B v3 model on RULER 4K/16K × 4 tasks (8 cells). Gate passes if:\n  * v4 loss ≤ v3 loss + 0.05\n  * v4 ≥ v3 - 0.02 in ≥ 5/8 cells\n  * v4 4K single_1 ≥ 0.30 (collapse floor)\n\n\nPASS → escalate to v4 5B head-to-head against v3 5B. FAIL → v3 remains the campaign champion, v4 not escalated.\n##   ⟨50⟩ 2. What's new in v4 \nTwo architectural improvements on top of v3's leak-fixed foundation:\n  1. **Learnable attention-pool descriptor** (`desc_attn_v`): replaces the fixed [mean/max/softmax-attn] triplet with a learned attention pool so the descriptor can highlight key-relevant features per chunk.\n  2. **Entropy bias on routing logits** (`ent_bias_scale`): adds a bias proportional to batch-level routing entropy, letting the router sharpen or smooth its decisions dynamically.\n\n\n##   ⟨51⟩ 3. Citation \n\n```\n@misc{dsc-v4-1b-2026,\n  author = {LLM-OS-Models},\n  title  = {DSC 370M FineWeb-Edu 1B v4 sanity check},\n  year   = {2026},\n  url    = {https://huggingface.co/LLM-OS-Models/dsc-370m-fineweb-edu-1b-v4}\n}\n\n```\nDownloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨53⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨54⟩\n Text Generation ⟨55⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨56⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨57⟩ Privacy⟨58⟩ About⟨59⟩ Careers⟨60⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
